.build.log

# Every `go build ./scripts/<name>` drops a binary named <name> in the repo
# root, and `git add -A` then sweeps it into a commit — a 3.7 MB Mach-O reached
# main that way. Build probes with `-o /tmp/...` instead; these names are the
# backstop for when someone forgets.
/frictionprobe
/corpusprobe
/decisionbench
/genmatrix
/miracl
/rankdiff
/searchbench
/demo
/pinmanifests
/mcpb
fixtures/synthetic/opencode.db
.deja-bench/
/longmemeval
/locomo

# Harness artefacts: running an agent inside this checkout to test an
# integration leaves its own history and config here. None of it belongs in
# the repository — three of these were committed by a careless `git add -A`.
.aider.chat.history.md
.aider.input.history
.aider.tags.cache.v*/
.grok/
.roo/
.cline/
.goose/
.opencode/
.qwen/
.kimi-code/

# compiled helpers from `go build ./scripts/...` — one line per scripts/ package
# so a stray binary never rides along in a commit again
/mcpb
/demo
/corpus
/pinmanifests
/genmatrix
/locomo
/longmemeval
/miracl
/dist/

# Generated by deja stats --card, not part of the repo
deja-stats.svg
